WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.720
It's been four months I've been staying at FF21's Koramangala branch.

00:03.980 --> 00:06.320
This PG has a good amount of safety.

00:06.620 --> 00:08.960
I personally work night shifts,

00:08.960 --> 00:13.660
and when I come back from work around 3 o'clock, the safety measures are still there.

00:13.840 --> 00:18.720
The biometrics for both the inside door and the outside door are quite great.

00:18.960 --> 00:20.440
Apart from that, I like the community here,

00:20.440 --> 00:23.080
and there are a lot of events at this PG.

00:23.280 --> 00:25.580
It's a good stay, and you should come over here.
